[36m(TaskRunner pid=3946209)[0m code="# Reusable function to calculate the minimum number of swaps to balance brackets\ndef swap_count(s):\n    open_count = 0\n    close_count = 0\n    for char in s:\n        if char == '[':\n            open_count += 1\n        else:\n            close_count += 1\n\n        if open_count > close_count:\n            open_count -= 1\n        elif close_count > open_count:\n            close_count -= 1\n\n    return open_count\n</answer>"
